          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 24:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achienderera kugomba na Musa achimuamba, “Mutu achimpiga myawe achimuolaga, naye naaolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.10+NUM.35.11+NUM.35.12+NUM.35.13+NUM.35.14+NUM.35.15+NUM.35.16+NUM.35.17+NUM.35.18+NUM.35.19+NUM.35.20+NUM.35.21+NUM.35.22+NUM.35.23+NUM.35.24+NUM.35.25+NUM.35.26+NUM.35.27+NUM.35.28+NUM.35.29+NUM.35.30+NUM.35.31+NUM.35.32+NUM.35.33+NUM.35.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 35:10–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.1+DEU.19.2+DEU.19.3+DEU.19.4+DEU.19.5+DEU.19.6+DEU.19.7+DEU.19.8+DEU.19.9+DEU.19.10+DEU.19.11+DEU.19.12+DEU.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 19:1–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.20.1+JOS.20.2+JOS.20.3+JOS.20.4+JOS.20.5+JOS.20.6+JOS.20.7+JOS.20.8+JOS.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 20:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala kamuolagire kusudi, ela Mlungu akarikubaliya, naachimbire aphiye kpwatu ndikoatsamburira atu dza hinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala akamuolaga myawe kusudi, hata akachimbirira phatu nilavirwapho sadaka, mtuluzeni mkamuolage vivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyempiga ise au nine naaolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 24:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu achimteka myawe achimguza akale mtumwa, au agbwirwe achere naye, naaolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 20:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.15.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 15:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 7:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amlaphizaye ise au nine ni aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho atu airi akakosana, na mmwenga atsole dziwe ampige myawe, au ampige ngumi amlumize hata akale kaweza kutuluka kondze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chisha aweze kugbwira fwimbo atuluke kondze, iye chiyempiga kandatiywa adabu. Ela ni amriphe hizo siku zosi arizokala chitandani na ahakikishe kukala andamrarisa hadi aphole tsetsetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu achimpiga fwimbo mtumwawe mlume au mchetu hata afwe. Iye ni atiywe adabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hiye mtumwa achikala kpwa siku mwenga au mbiri ndipho achifwa, hiye mwenye mtumwa asitiywe adabu kpwa sababu iye mtumwa ni maliye mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho alume anaheha, na katika kuheha kpwao amlumize mchetu mwenye mimba hata avoromose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kuvoromosa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Hipha Chieburania phanaweza kukala na mana ya kuvyala mwana ambaye kadzangbwephera.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ela akale taamlumizire zaidi ya hiko kuvoromosa, ye mkosa andaripha ndivyoambwa ni mlume wa hiye mchetu, na kulengana na aamuli ndivyoamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala hiye mchetu akalumira kutsupa hiko kuvoromosa, phahi hiye achiyegahenda andaripha uhai kpwa uhai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.24.19+LEV.24.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 24:19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 19:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dzitso kpwa dzitso, dzino kpwa dzino, mkpwono kpwa mkpwono, lwayo kpwa lwayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chironda cha moho kpwa chironda cha moho, jaraha kpwa jaraha, kuvwarurwa kpwa kuvwarurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu achimpiga mtumwawe mchetu au mlume hadi achimuombola dzitso, naamrichire huru kpwa sababu ya hiro dzitsore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona mutu achimpiga mtumwawe mchetu au mlume hata achimngʼola dzino, iye naye naamrichire huru kpwa sababu ya hiro dzinore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu achienderera kugomba na Musa achiamba “Ngʼombe ichipiga mutu hadi ichimuolaga, naipigbwe mawe hata ifwe, na msiirye; ela iye mwenye ngʼombe andakala kana makosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala iyo ngʼombe ikabara kupiga atu na iye mwenye wakanywa ela kashuulika, ichipiga mutu tsona ichimuolaga, naipigbwe mawe ifwe, na ye mwenye ngʼombe naye ni aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala hinyo achioolagirwa mutu wao andalonda kuriphiwa, phahi ye mwenye ngʼombe ni aariphe mara mwenga naye andakala akativya rohoye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lagizo hiri mundarilunga hata wakati ngʼombe ndiphokala ikaolaga mwanache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼombe ichiolaga mtumwa mchetu au mlume, hiye mwenye ngʼombe andamripha hiye mwenye mtumwa vipande mirongo mihahu vya feza, halafu yo ngʼombe ipigbwe mawe hata ifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu achiricha dibwa bila kuribwiningiza, au achitsimba dibwa halafu achiriricha laza, alafu ngʼombe au punda wa myawe edze agbwe na afwe mumo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiye mwenye hiro dibwa naamriphe pesa hiye mwenye nyama halafu iye ahale ye nyama wa kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼombe ya mutu ichipiga ngʼombe ya mutu wanjina, ichiiolaga, yo ngʼombe iriyo moyo naihalwe iguzwe, na hinyo enye ngʼombe zichizopigana aganye zo pesa, na yo ngʼombe ya kufwa nayo aiganye sawa-sawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala iyo ngʼombe inamanyikana kukala kaziye ni kupiga ngʼombe zanjina na kuziolaga, na hiye mwenye akashindwa ni kuifunga, phahi iyo ngʼombe andairipha na ngʼombe, halafu ahale iyo ngʼombe ya kufwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
